# end-1813-allies: 1813 as the Allies, one player, Tactical off. The player only ends turns;
# the computer plays the French. A digest at the main menu of each of its 4 turns.
# Written by tests/make_scripts.py.
#! seed 48152

# A TICK: any key ends it. A pause that waits for a key: a space. The End Turn
# question and the End Game question: Yes. A retreat the player is asked to choose:
# Esc, which lets the game choose.
rule 3 key f12
rule 1 key space
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key esc

# The built-in title, then the start menu: Start NEW Game, the year.
play until 2:W
text s
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter

# The main menu. Utility: Tactical off.
play until 2:M
digest
text u
prompt
text t
prompt
key esc

# Each turn: a digest at the main menu, then End Turn.
repeat 4
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end

# The game ends: the Battle Summary, the Hall of Fame and Game Over.

# The start menu: Quit to DOS, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:W
digest
text q
repeat space
